OL,3,GNEWSASugarbabes and Craig David to
OL,4,Aheadline GuilFest
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraig David and the Sugarbabes will
OL,7,Fheadline GuilFest in 2027, it has been
OL,8,Fannounced.
OL,10,FOrganiser Tony Scott broke the news
OL,11,Flive on BBC Radio Surrey on Friday,
OL,12,Fsaying it was "so good bringing
OL,13,FGuilFest back yet again for another
OL,14,Fyear".
OL,16,FThe festival, in Guildford's Stoke
OL,17,FPark, is set to take place on 3 and 4
OL,18,FJuly.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
