OL,3,GNEWSASugarbabes and Craig David to
OL,4,Aheadline GuilFest
OL,5,
OL,6,FScouting for Girls, Pixie Lott and
OL,7,FToploader are also on the line-up for
OL,8,Fthe Saturday. Happy Mondays, Sara Cox
OL,9,Fand Shalamar are among the acts set to
OL,10,Fperform on the Sunday.
